# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Canonicalize all URLs to trailing-slash so Google
# doesn't index both /blog/foo and /blog/foo/. Astro also enforces this at
# build time (trailingSlash: 'always'), but this is a belt-and-suspenders rule
# in case anything links to the non-trailing form.

/blog/*   /blog/:splat/   301
/about    /about/         301
/book-a-call  /book-a-call/  301
